    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱᾰνό-κροκα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτά</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>: but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰανο-κρήδεμνος</span></b> 
		(sic), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, is expld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰοῖς ὅμοιον τὸ ἐπικράνισμα</span>, Id.;
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ στέμμα ἐξ ἴων φορῶν</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Suid.
		</span></i> (Prob. compds. of a dialectic form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑανός</span>, wh. (viz. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑανός</span>) is glossed <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλακός</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτός, λαμπρός</span> in Sch.<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			18.613
		</span></i>.) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰανόφρυς</span></b> , prob.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυαν-</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMich.</u>
				11.13
			</span></i>.</div>
